<p class="yi-text yi-text--lg">Pausing a rollout <strong class="yi-text">does not roll back</strong> hosts that have already been updated. Resume it, or start a rollback <em class="yi-text">before</em> the next maintenance window.</p>
<small class="yi-text yi-text--subtle">Rollbacks are recorded in the audit log.</small>
